* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_ucbet (reference/crafted.toml, 17 Nov 2026): the VDA "betting"
* constraints EQG_UCMAX and EQG_UCSUMAX (ucbet.vda L46-125, included from equ_ext.vda L99 when
* UC_FLOBET is DEFINED; M1.3 change 47, docs/m13-plan.md). Added to TIMES_Demo demo12
* (etsap-TIMES/TIMES_Demo @ 962db86, CC BY 4.0).
* Each constraint is cumulative (a bound without a period), and its variable is at least each of
* the weighted cumulative activities or flows UC_ACTBET / UC_FLOBET name, so its bound limits the
* largest of them. init_ext.vda L132 copies UC_ACTBET into UC_FLOBET with the commodity %PGPRIM%
* (ACT). The four constraints take the four branches of EQG_UCMAX:
* - BET_ACT (global bound UC_RHS): the activity of each process in each region (ucbet.vda L89-103),
*   with the discounting attribute PERDISC in REG1; MINGAS1 is an exchange process (its imports).
* - BET_ACTG (global bound, UC_ATTR ACT N): the activity of each process summed over the regions
*   (L105-119), the IMPEXP group of L25-26.
* - BET_FLO (regional bounds UC_RHSR): the flows of each commodity in each region (L57-71), with
*   EQG_UCSUMAX summing the regional variables (L123-125); PERDISC in REG2; IMPGAS1's imports.
* - BET_FLOG (global bound): the flows of each commodity summed over the regions (L73-87).
* Each bound is about a quarter below the largest of its cumulative values in demo12, so every
* constraint binds in GAMS's optimum.
$ONEMPTY
$ONEPS
$ONWARNING
SET UC_N
/
BET_ACT 'Largest cumulative activity of a power plant or gas supply'
BET_ACTG 'Largest cumulative activity, regions summed'
BET_FLO 'Largest cumulative flow of a commodity, by region'
BET_FLOG 'Largest cumulative flow of a commodity, regions summed'
/

PARAMETER
UC_ACTBET ' '/
BET_ACT.REG1.2005.ELCTNCOA01 1
BET_ACT.REG1.2005.ELCTNGAS01 1
BET_ACT.REG1.2005.MINGAS1 0.5
BET_ACT.REG2.2005.ELCTNCOA01 1
BET_ACTG.REG1.2005.ELCTNGAS01 1
BET_ACTG.REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01 0.8
BET_ACTG.REG1.2005.MINCOA1 0.25
BET_ACTG.REG2.2005.MINCOA1 0.25
/

PARAMETER
UC_FLOBET ' '/
BET_FLO.REG1.2005.ELCTNGAS01.ELC 1
BET_FLO.REG1.2005.ELCTNCOA01.ELC 1
BET_FLO.REG1.2005.ELCTNCOA01.ELCCOA 0.5
BET_FLO.REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.ELC 1
BET_FLO.REG2.2005.IMPGAS1.GAS 1
BET_FLOG.REG1.2005.MINGAS1.GAS 1
BET_FLOG.REG2.2005.MINGAS1.GAS 1
BET_FLOG.REG1.2005.ELCTNGAS01.ELCGAS 0.5
/

SET UC_ATTR
/
REG1.BET_ACT.LHS.ACT.PERDISC
REG1.BET_ACTG.LHS.ACT.N
REG2.BET_ACTG.LHS.ACT.N
REG2.BET_FLO.LHS.ACT.PERDISC
/

PARAMETER
UC_RHS ' '/
BET_ACT.UP 16000
BET_ACTG.UP 125000
BET_FLOG.UP 28000
/

PARAMETER
UC_RHSR ' '/
REG1.BET_FLO.UP 90000
REG2.BET_FLO.UP 210000
/
